fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"video/gstvideometa.html#gst_video_meta_transform_matrix_point_clipped","fragment":"\n\tgst_video_meta_transform_matrix_point_clipped\n\n\n\tGstVideo.VideoMetaTransformMatrix.prototype.point_clipped\n\n\n\tGstVideo.VideoMetaTransformMatrix.point_clipped\n\nTransforms the (@x, y) point from the input coordinates to the\noutput ones.  The point's coordinates are transformed by first\napplying the transform.matrix to it using the top left (x, y) of\ntransform.in_rectangle as the origin, then translate it to use\nthe top-left of transform.out_rectangle as new origin.\nParameters:\na GstVideoMetaTransformMatrix\na non-NULL pointer to the X value of the coordinate\na non-NULL pointer to the Y value of the coordinate\nFALSE if the point is outside of transform.out_rectangle\nafter the transformation has been applied\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nTransforms the (@x, y) point from the input coordinates to the\noutput ones.  The point's coordinates are transformed by first\napplying the transform.matrix to it using the top left (x, y) of\ntransform.in_rectangle as the origin, then translate it to use\nthe top-left of transform.out_rectangle as new origin.\nParameters:\na GstVideo.VideoMetaTransformMatrix\na non-NULL pointer to the X value of the coordinate\na non-NULL pointer to the Y value of the coordinate\nReturns a tuple made of:\nfalse if the point is outside of transform.out_rectangle\nafter the transformation has been applied\nfalse if the point is outside of transform.out_rectangle\nafter the transformation has been applied\nfalse if the point is outside of transform.out_rectangle\nafter the transformation has been applied\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nTransforms the (@x, y) point from the input coordinates to the\noutput ones.  The point's coordinates are transformed by first\napplying the transform.matrix to it using the top left (x, y) of\ntransform.in_rectangle as the origin, then translate it to use\nthe top-left of transform.out_rectangle as new origin.\nParameters:\na GstVideo.VideoMetaTransformMatrix\na non-NULL pointer to the X value of the coordinate\na non-NULL pointer to the Y value of the coordinate\nReturns a tuple made of:\nFalse if the point is outside of transform.out_rectangle\nafter the transformation has been applied\nFalse if the point is outside of transform.out_rectangle\nafter the transformation has been applied\nFalse if the point is outside of transform.out_rectangle\nafter the transformation has been applied\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});